# AVARUMCashInvoiceController - Form Integration Guide

## 🎯 Purpose

The **AVARUMCashInvoiceController** enables seamless integration between forms and the Cash Invoice report by automatically pre-filling the voucher parameter when the report is called from a form button.

---

