## 🎯 Advanced Scenarios

### Scenario 1: Print Without Dialog

If you want to print directly without showing the dialog:

```xpp
public static void printDirect(AVARUMCashVoucher _cashVoucher)
{
    AVARUMCashInvoiceController controller = new AVARUMCashInvoiceController();
    AVARUMCashInvoiceContract contract;
    
    controller.parmReportName(ssrsReportStr(AVARUMCashInvoice, Report));
    
    // Get contract and set parameter
    contract = controller.parmReportContract().parmRdpContract() 
               as AVARUMCashInvoiceContract;
    contract.parmAVARUMCashVoucher(_cashVoucher);
    
    // Don't show dialog
    controller.parmShowDialog(false);
    
    // Run report
    controller.startOperation();
}
```

