## ✅ Best Practices

### DO ✅

- ✅ Always call `super()` in prePromptModifyContract()
- ✅ Check if Args and Args.record() exist before using
- ✅ Verify dataset matches expected table
- ✅ Use parmShowDialog(true) unless you have a good reason not to
- ✅ Set NeedsRecord=Yes on form buttons
- ✅ Test both form-based and standalone scenarios

### DON'T ❌

- ❌ Don't skip validation in contract
- ❌ Don't assume Args will always contain a record
- ❌ Don't hard-code report design name (use ssrsReportStr)
- ❌ Don't remove user's ability to override pre-filled values
- ❌ Don't forget to handle null/empty Args

